vsk-labs commands

Available commands:
  database status          Inspect control-database status.
    --config <path>        Read the protected server profile at this explicit path.
    --output <format>      Select human or versioned JSON output. Allowed: human, json.
    --schema-version <major> Select the machine-contract schema major. Allowed: 1.
  help                     Show generated command help.
    --output <format>      Select human or versioned JSON output. Allowed: human, json.
    --schema-version <major> Select the machine-contract schema major. Allowed: 1.
  inventory diff           Compare one inert draft or local candidate with a compatible inert draft.
    --captured-at <timestamp> Record an RFC 3339 UTC capture time.
    --config <path>        Read the protected server profile at this explicit path.
    --draft-id <id>        Select an existing inert draft.
    --draft-revision <revision> Select the exact inert draft revision.
    --file <path>          Read one protected local candidate file.
    --format <format>      Select the explicit candidate format. Allowed: labs-sheet1-csv, typed-json.
    --output <format>      Select human or versioned JSON output. Allowed: human, json.
    --schema-version <major> Select the machine-contract schema major. Allowed: 1.
    --source-revision <revision> Record the source revision supplied by its owner.
  inventory export         Publish one verified signed inert-draft export.
    --config <path>        Read the protected server profile at this explicit path.
    --draft-id <id>        Select an existing inert draft.
    --draft-revision <revision> Select the exact inert draft revision.
    --output <format>      Select human or versioned JSON output. Allowed: human, json.
    --schema-version <major> Select the machine-contract schema major. Allowed: 1.
  inventory import         Validate and store one inventory candidate as an inert draft.
    --captured-at <timestamp> Record an RFC 3339 UTC capture time.
    --config <path>        Read the protected server profile at this explicit path.
    --expected-state-revision <revision> Require this current state revision.
    --file <path>          Read one protected local candidate file.
    --format <format>      Select the explicit candidate format. Allowed: labs-sheet1-csv, typed-json.
    --idempotency-key <key> Supply one opaque retry key.
    --output <format>      Select human or versioned JSON output. Allowed: human, json.
    --schema-version <major> Select the machine-contract schema major. Allowed: 1.
    --source-revision <revision> Record the source revision supplied by its owner.
  release inspect          Inspect a local release manifest and compatibility without claiming cryptographic verification.
    --manifest <path>      Read the local release manifest at this path.
    --output <format>      Select human or versioned JSON output. Allowed: human, json.
    --schema-version <major> Select the machine-contract schema major. Allowed: 1.
  release verify           Verify a signed local manifest and explicitly selected assets against a supplied offline policy.
    --all                  Explicitly verify every asset in the manifest.
    --asset <id>           Verify one named asset; repeat for additional assets.
    --manifest <path>      Read the local release manifest at this path.
    --output <format>      Select human or versioned JSON output. Allowed: human, json.
    --policy <path>        Read the supplied local trust policy at this path.
    --schema-version <major> Select the machine-contract schema major. Allowed: 1.
  server run               Run the persistent control service in the foreground.
    --config <path>        Read the protected server profile at this explicit path.
    --output <format>      Select human or versioned JSON output. Allowed: human, json.
    --schema-version <major> Select the machine-contract schema major. Allowed: 1.
  server status            Query control-service health.
    --config <path>        Read the protected server profile at this explicit path.
    --output <format>      Select human or versioned JSON output. Allowed: human, json.
    --schema-version <major> Select the machine-contract schema major. Allowed: 1.
  status                   Show the current platform summary.
    --config <path>        Read the protected server profile at this explicit path.
    --output <format>      Select human or versioned JSON output. Allowed: human, json.
    --schema-version <major> Select the machine-contract schema major. Allowed: 1.
  version                  Show the vsk-labs build and contract version.
    --output <format>      Select human or versioned JSON output. Allowed: human, json.
    --schema-version <major> Select the machine-contract schema major. Allowed: 1.

Planned commands (unavailable):
  apply                    Execute one current, authorized immutable plan.
  audit                    Inspect sanitized audit history.
  backup run               Run one exact approved backup policy.
  backup status            Inspect backup status.
  backup verify            Verify a declared backup.
  connect                  Open a constrained connection to an authorized node endpoint.
  control-plane plan       Create an immutable control-plane change plan.
  control-plane recover    Create an inert control-plane recovery change.
  control-plane verify     Verify control-plane health and authority.
  database backup          Create a verified control-database backup.
  database export          Export authorized sanitized control data.
  database restore         Create an inert control-database restore change.
  database verify          Verify control-database integrity or backup content.
  device approve           Create an inert device-approval change.
  device request           Create an inert device-enrollment request.
  device revoke            Create an inert device-revocation change.
  doctor                   Diagnose one actionable platform invariant at a time.
  gate check               Evaluate applicable gates without changing infrastructure.
  gate evidence            Validate evidence and create an inert evidence change.
  gate inspect             Inspect one gate and its evidence requirements.
  gate list                List applicable implementation gates.
  maintenance plan         Create an immutable maintenance plan.
  maintenance run          Run one authorized maintenance plan.
  node add                 Create an inert managed-node change.
  node discover            Discover a candidate managed node.
  node inspect             Inspect a managed node.
  node nominate            Create an inert role-nomination change.
  node quarantine          Create an inert node-quarantine change.
  node replace             Create an inert node-replacement change.
  plan                     Create an immutable plan from an inert change.
  restore plan             Create an immutable restore plan.
  restore run              Run one authorized restore plan.
  restore verify           Verify a completed restore.
  service deploy           Create an inert service-deployment change.
  service plan             Create an inert service change and request its plan.
  service rollback         Create an inert service-rollback change.
  user offboard            Create an inert user-offboarding change.
  user onboard             Create an inert user-onboarding change.
  user resume              Create an inert user-resumption change.
  user suspend             Create an inert user-suspension change.
